[gd_scene format=3]

; One variable: the editor kite of a Bone2D chain (skeleton_2d.cpp:189-354). It draws only with the
; Gizmos toggle on, which the goldens bone2d-unselected and bone2d-selected set, so no other scene shows
; a regression in it. The chain holds a bone turned and scaled by its
; parent, a child bone that sets its own gizmo off, a leaf that draws along its authored length and
; angle, and a leaf that calculates its angle from its own rotation. Upper bone scale 1.5 shows the
; kite width staying 5 pixels where the bone grows.

